This distribution packages SCATTER's existing calling and UMI-quantification
implementation and a user-selected DeepTSSFilter Shift model.

The single-cell output workflow is inspired by CamoTSS:
Hou R., Hon C.C., Huang Y. CamoTSS: analysis of alternative transcription
start sites for cellular phenotypes and regulatory patterns from 5' scRNA-seq
data. Nature Communications 14, 7240 (2023).
https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-023-42636-1
https://github.com/StatBiomed/CamoTSS

CamoTSS is not bundled or required at runtime. Its code, model weights,
benchmark data and name are not represented as SCATTER assets.
The miniature demonstration contains artificial cells/reads/annotation and
GRCh38-derived DNA; its provenance is in scatter/data/description.json.
